ss=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Forsaken Chronicles Guide</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Glory: The Flame</b><br /> Upside: Fast, hard, and hot. You\u2019re a damn good time and you\u2019ve got the energy to create a lot of stir as you burn through a long line of lovers. (Or just one lover over and over). (...)<br /> Downside: You invented the fear of commitment. It\u2019s not that you don\u2019t want to settle down, maybe you do, but it\u2019s just so hard. That said, when you do dedicate yourself to one person, you\u2019ll burn each other out so fast and so hard Bonnie and Clyde will be forgotten in favor of your story. It\u2019s just harder, your reputation is ahead of you.</div> </div> </div> </div>More than cold-hearted Tsun, I could easily see Yandare she-wolf, envy about &quot;this new bitch&quot; you brought to your life in her place...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T12:22:54-08:00","id":749695,"title":"","content":"At this rate, we should probably throw in fansplats....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T12:49:33-08:00","id":749822,"title":"","content":"a Leviathan would probably take you on a tour of some beautiful and romantic underwater location if you have a high enough relationship with them. Something like a coral reef that mortal man doesn't know about or an underwater city or the wreck of the Titanic or the Leviathan shifts to their largest form and has something like that underwater hotel in Figi put on their back that you can stay in while they take you on a romantic tour of the ocean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"h