ustom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T20:49:44-08:00","id":752912,"title":"","content":"Didn't Gravity Falls already <a href=\"http://gravityfalls.wikia.com/wiki/.GIFfany\" target=\"_blank\">answer this question</a>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T14:15:41-08:00","id":772517,"title":"","content":"Okay, possibly silly question: are there any options for a Sin-Eater and Geist who are deeply in love with each other and want to marry? Could a krewe with a &quot;love transcends death&quot; theme offer such unorthodox celebrations? Could this bonding be improved with a Pledge-like Ceremony that increases their resistance against mind control powers meant to force them to hurt each other? Would they have to travel to the Underworld and seek an audience with a strangely romantic Kerberos who might seek to make them prove if they really love each other?<br /> <br /> I'm asking this because I'm thinking of DLC for this imaginary dating sim where the protagonist can acquire a major splat, or turn out to have been a member of a major splat all along.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T16:09:39-08:00","id":772594,"title":"","content":"I will admit i play a LOT Of shoujo games... <br /> <br /> Hmmmn say a love interest of each splat... say a Daeva girl whos got a last sliver of kindness deep down in her heart... but is ultimately dangerous and deadly...<br /> <br /> a Storm Lord Who wants Hunt down and slay the Pure bastard who offed her father... but her heart is moved to kindness again ...<br /> <br /> Not really familiar with mages or changling the lost...<br /> <br /> oh maybe a Decadent member of ashwood abbey?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T17:17:25-08:00","id":772653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"><