T19:09:20-08:00","id":772719,"title":"","content":"It occurred to me...with Paradox buying White Wolf this could actually be a thing now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T22:04:12-08:00","id":772816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=772670#post772670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only way to possibly reduce AA to less ... evil roles is to play up the old money subfaction</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Didn't Compacts and Conspiracies retcon it so that the rapey murdery part of the AA was just a loud minority, and that many chapters of the Abby didn't even count as hunters and just held supernatural orgies and hung around with supernaturals for the rush? I bet you could include a lover from one of those chapters, maybe with his or her plot involving them getting the courage to stand up to a relative from one of &quot;those&quot; chapters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T03:15:35-08:00","id":772897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GottaGoFeast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=772517#post772517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, possibly silly question: are there any options for a Sin-Eater and Geist who are deeply in love with each other and want to marry? Could a krewe with a &quot;love transcends death&quot; theme offer such unorthodox celebrations? Could this bonding be improved with a Pledge-like Ceremony that increases their resistance against mind control powers meant to force them to hurt each other? Would they have to travel to the Underworld and seek an audience with a strangely romantic Kerberos who might seek to make them prove if they really love each other?<br /> <br /> I'm asking this because I'm thinking of DLC for this imaginary dating sim where the protagonist can acquire a major splat, or turn out to have been a member of a major splat all along.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aren't Sin-Eaters and their Geists <i>already</i> kinda married? Or more-than-married, really? &quot;Two-souls as one&quot; and &quot;until death do we part&quot; is kinda literal here.<br /> <br /> ...I wonder if they get in trouble with any other partners for bringing someone else in?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=772594#post772594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh maybe a Decadent member of ashwood abbey?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you could always spin them as a bad boy/girl who was mostly just doing the AA's crap just to act out (and never crossed any unforgivable lines during it). Rich, bored dilettante desperately trying to find meaning, then along comes [Protagonist Love Interest].","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T18:48:58-08:00","id":775727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=772897#post772897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Aren't Sin-Eaters and their Geists <i>already</i> kinda married? Or more-than-married, really? &quot;Two-souls as one&quot; and &quot;until death do we part&quot; is kinda literal here.<br /> <br /> ...I wonder if they get in trouble with any other partners for bringing someone else in?<br /> <br /> Well you could always spin them as a bad boy/girl who was mostly just doing the AA's crap just to act out (and never crossed any unforgivable lines during it). Rich, bored dilettante desperately trying to find meaning, then along comes [Protagonist Love Interest].</div> </div> </div> </div> Well, the Bargain with the Geist doesn't have to be that profound every time. I imagine it's a quite mercenary relationship for a fair number of Sin-Eaters. Some lazy or desperate Geister might look at a mortal and pretty much think &quot;meh, you'll have to do&quot;. I'm talking about an honest-to-goodness marriage. Maybe one that persists even after death.<br /> <br /> That &quot;troubled soul who's disillusioned with wealth and looking for the true meaning of life&quot; interpretation of an Abbey Hunter/Huntress would certainly fit into a romantic story, but it would need something new to make it stand out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 11-27-2015, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T20:26:37-08:00","id":775766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GottaGoFeast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=775727#post775727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm talking about an honest-to-goodness marriage. Maybe one that persists even after death.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's only tangentially related, but I feel like bringing up the fact that <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/75694-help-me-understand-mourners?p=75745#post75745\">Alice's geist</a> knew of her from his mortal days thanks to the prophetic brain-fever that introduced him to his own geist, who shared a particular striking feature with Alice herself.<br /> <br /> \u2026Speaking of which, what subgenre of dating sim are we primarily assuming is at play here? Because otome games are going to have a bit of a different tenor than something like, say, Muv-Luv.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T21:49:08-08:00","id":775796,"title":"","content":"Horrible idea from Princess the Hopeful.<br /> <br /> You suddenly fall in love with a Prince(ss) of Mirrors and all of your options are variations on &quot;you're the best person in existence&quot; or something railroaded to the Mirror's benefit because s/he's used the Meet Cute charm whose explicit function is to make people (who fit the criteria the Mirror sets out) fall in love with them. The goal of the game then becomes &quot;try getting out of an unnatural relationship&quot; that requires help from another supernatural to get out of (preferably another Princess with Unweaving) due to the Mirror being able to completely keep up your false feelings by simply recasting the charm. And god help you if s/he gets a Dramatic Failure on the charm. Although while you don't get affected, dramatically failing the Meet Cute charm literally gives them the <b>Yandereism Condition</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":9750,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","user":"SaulottheGentle","date":". 11-28-2015, 12:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T15:10:10-08:00","id":776225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GottaGoFeast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=775727#post775727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Well, the Bargain with the Geist doesn't have to be that profound every time. I imagine it's a quite mercenary relationship for a fair number of Sin-Eaters. Some lazy or desperate Geister might look at a mortal and pretty much think &quot;meh, you'll have to do&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, there are a number of <i>real</i> marriages that fit those criteria too...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","v