ype":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T18:16:12-08:00","id":776334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=776282#post776282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're gonna have to explain this for those of us who miss the reference I am afraid.</div> </div> </div> </div>'<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1VCe3Iz-ieE\" target=\"_blank\">Kay</a>. Obviously the context is... a little off, but whatever. The romantic, aesthetic side of &quot;descending into the depths with an ancient&quot; starts around 1:50- the part before that is why I <i>uhhhughugh</i>'ed.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T20:35:08-08:00","id":820115,"title":"","content":"I resurrect this thread <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/LightNovel/HaiyoreNyarkoSan\" target=\"_blank\">