ar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T11:33:05-08:00","id":820462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=820176#post820176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And on that note: I present another bit of creepy WoD dating advice... make sure your potential GF is not a clone of your mother.</div> </div> </div> </div>...And if she is, use a goddamn condom. Every time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T13:18:01-08:00","id":820536,"title":"","content":"So, I've been reading <i>all</i> the Mage dev blogs again for the n-th time (agh! need... 2e... now...) and got to the supernal summoning Attainments. I don't know, how exactly will they work in 2e, but they gave me this idea of a mage who falls in love with a Supernal being during their awakening and keeps seeing them anytime the mage activates their Mage Sight (apparently having a Supernal ally you see like this is a Merit in 2e too!), but can't even touch them.<br /> <br /> The relationship would have serious star-crossed lovers undertones and a constant temptation for the mage to repeatedly summon the being fully into reality to experience at least some moments of physical contact. Predictable consequences would probably follow soon after.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T02:25:38-08:00","id":820849,"title":"","content":"Idea for Settings:<br /> <br /> A &quot;Middle/High School&quot; that's actually in the Hedge and all the characters are locked into their behaviors by the Headmaster/Mistress (who would also be one of the potential Romances and an Antagonist) who is a True Fae that has Kidnapped and manipulated all the Supernaturals into a Game.... If they can find their true Love they can go free with the True Love. ALL the other characters (Teachers, Pupils etc) that are not one of the Romancable routes are Either Changelings who have Failed to break out (who may or may not have been in the position of the Protagonist previously) or Fae &quot;Actors&quot; cast as the uninteresting parts.<br /> <br /> A Winter Retreat for the various Supernaturals that is ran by a Neutral 3rd party, That arranges for the various needs of the Different Supernaturals (Arranging a New Mystery every Year, Ensuring there are enough Blood dolls to go around Etc) and tries to keep the Violence down to a Minimum. (The Owner is likely a Beast and has several Other Begotten on Staff to help with the Management.) Occasionally they deal with Special requests and/or Deals/Bets between the various Supernaturals, these in the past have included &quot;Arranging&quot; a breakdown and Blizzard to strand a Family in the Resort and Forcing them to Ally with the Supernatural Elements at the Resort so they can survive. The object of these Bets usually are let into the Bet after the bet has been won and/or they have became one of the Supernaturals. (Not all the Factions/Splats can forcibly transform people, but that just means the bet is Over if they Willingly Join that faction for protection. Atleast one of the Staff is a Mage with the Mind Arcana and can erase the memories of those involved if that is necessary)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T16:47:21-08:00","id":821301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=772816#post772816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Didn't Compacts and Conspiracies retcon it so that the rapey murdery part of the AA was just a loud minority, and that many chapters of the Abby didn't even count as hunters and just held supernatural orgies and hung around with supernaturals for the rush? I bet you could include a lover from one of those chapters, maybe with his or her plot involving them getting the courage to stand up to a relative from one of &amp;quot;those&amp;quot; chapters.</div> </div> </div> </div> Damn that was the best part about the Abbey ;p, okay not to everyone's taste, but fictionalized rape, murder, other assorted evils doesn't bother (real life does, I'm not a pyschopath or a slasher, I'm compassion in my own way).<br /> <br /> And lets be honest, many game lines have rape vibes given off. Various Beasts, A Illes or Romantic Kiths Keepers, Vampires pretty much all of them, Ivory Claw Werewolves, the Claimed, Infernal Demons of lust, possibly others.<br /> <br /> Anyways for a dating sim a True Fae that is literally the whole date sim world. So the True Fae is all the men/women/other dates, the chair your sitting in, the venues you go to, even the condom you use. And you know none of it till you lose or win the &quot;sim&quot;. Victory and Defeat leads to escape where you end up a Changeling Romantic Kith (either Grimm or Loyalist, or Fairest for victory or Darkling, Orger, Wizen or Elemental for defeat).<br /> <br /> A Demiurge that builds Promeathan Muse &quot;dates&quot; could be horrifying, but interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T16:49:07-08:00","id":822882,"title":"","content":"This all sounds like something from Writing.com, where you have five choices at the start of the game and each one diverges off into around two to five other paths that the player could take. Actually, in general a choose your own adventure style game may benefit from this kind of thing.<br /> <br /> What kind of supernatural would the player character be, if not a mortal? Beasts would have the best chance at woohooing other characters, with various options to make themselves appear like the same kind of supernatural that the other is, but it would come with the pitfalls of the Heroes...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T18:51:27-08:00","id":822949,"title":"","content":"What sort of romance scenarios would you actually want to see in the Chronicles of Darkness?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T18:56:34-08:00","id":822951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=822949#post822949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What sort of romance scenarios would you actually want to see in the Chronicles of Darkness?</div> </div> </div> </div>It may be cliche, but perhaps one where the player helps a Changeling come to terms with themselves after the change, and the world they live in? Acting as an anchor without being an emotional crutch?<br /> <br /> There was a scenario too in Baron Nerak's Geist game &quot;Balance of Shadows&quot; where the krewe worked to get two ghosts who couldn't be together in life have a wedding in death, allowing them to pass on while also giving the characters an excuse to have a gothic ghost wedding ceremony with many others (both mortal and supernatural) invited. It was rather nice, and could potentially be a venture a player could engage in, possibly strengthening their own relationship with the other they want to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T20:28:08-08:00","id":823014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=822949#post822949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What sort of romance scenarios would you actually want to see in the Chronicles of Darkness?</div> </div> </div> </div>In the game I'm currently running, one of the players has a pretty interesting love story going on with an NPC that I think fits CofD very well.<br /> <br /> He met the girl a couple of weeks before the story started, and they hit it off super well. He was a socially awkward rookie at the police academy and she was an amateur singer with tons of charisma. They bonded over their love for cheesy action flicks. One week before the story started, she left him a note, asking him to meet her by the old oak tree (it was a meaningful landmark in their relationship). when he arrived, he saw her waiting for him, worried. Before she could say anything, long, gnarled hands grabbed her and dragged her deep into the woods.<br /> <br /> Now, here is where Fate was altered. Normally, he would've chased after her, both shouting each other's name. She would've been taken to Arcadia, and he would've become a Fae-Touched Hunter, specialised in Fae lore and always holding out hope that he'd find her, or that she'd return.<br /> <br /> But his Fate was tampered with. He was marked for death in a ritual, and one of the old trees splintered when he was running past it, dropping a heavy branch on his head and killing him instantly. When he returned as one of the Bound, he was amnesic. He had her note, but he didn't remember her at all. The Keeper that took the girl left a Fetch behind. Every Fetch has a flaw, something they're missing. The flaw on the girl's Fetch is that she doesn't remember him either.<br /> <br /> Now, as he struggles to piece his past together and solve the mysteries left behind by the person who marked him for Geist-dom, he has to deal with the outcome of the events that transpired that day. Neither of them are mortal any longer.<br /> <br /> I look forward to seeing what happens with that relationship, personally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T01:42:16-08:00","id":823161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=822949#post822949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What sort of romance scenarios would you actually want to see in the Chronicles of Darkness?</div> </div> </div> </div>None. None at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T11:43:53-08:00","id":823557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/640173-nsfw-nwod-as-a-dating-simulator-what-would-it-be-like?p=823161#post823161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">None. None at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>And that's fine!<br /> <br /> But why are you here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","